  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKNIAF: Nigeria Power Sector Support Project (Technical Assistance to Government)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UKNIAF: Nigeria Power Sector Support Project (Technical Assistance to Government) is a component of  UK Nigeria Infrastructure Advisory Facility (UKNIAF) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;3,714,736. It works in the following sector(s): Energy policy and administrative management, Transport policy and administrative management, Public finance management (PFM), Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation, Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
